Yim6JTB8iILKkWMfQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfypnYvhG-vFf9cAj7OUow0pHx18FElRvnoyrbdgTSg4XA&oe=69B2A96E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Dizmo Tag V2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "In Dizmo Tag v2, you\u2019ll master a unique physics-based locomotion system that lets you run, jump, climb, and vault through fully explorable 3D environments. Whether you\u2019re racing through a dense forest map, scaling walls in a neon-lit arena, or sneaking through tight alleyways in an urban setting, every surface is a playground\u2014and every player is your target or your pursuer.\n\nBuilt from the ground up with community feedback in mind, Dizmo Tag v2 introduces new maps, smoother mechanics, and a growing library of custom cosmetics and skins to personalize your primate. Jump into lobbies with friends or match up with strangers for high-speed tag showdowns that test your agility, awareness, and creativity.", "short_description": "Dizmo Tag v2 is a fast-paced, multiplayer VR fan game inspired by Gorilla Tag. Dive into a vibrant world of parkour-style tag where you run, jump, and climb using nothing but your hands. With enhanced movement mechanics, unique maps, and a growing collection of custom cosmetics, Dizmo Tag v2 delivers high-energy fun and endless replayability."}]}, "developer_name": "CJ", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/dizmotagv2privacypolicy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "CJ", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/dizmotagv2/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_a